<description>&lt;p&gt;The military court sentenced 66 Congolese soldiers to death for cowardice and mutiny after they fled fighting FRN rebels, intensifying pressure on the FARDC as the FRN advances on multiple fronts. ISIS-linked militants killed 33 people, causing patients to flee a hospital and raising concerns about Ebola spread. Allied Democratic Forces militants attacked Cantine in North Kivu, further destabilising the area. The WHO warned that cholera has killed 1,800 people in the Democratic Republic of the Congo. Battle-related deaths totaled 1,158 in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5hWENNVUc2eUc4ajBIQlZ4aUF5RnF2TnJCVlFCY0RrNkhZbTBweGRlemxnbEY0ZTk0bl9CcnpFRTU2ZmdKSExyNzRMdnNnZlIzRjFoQ0dEMDV1YVlSV1HSAWNBVV95cUxQS1JVQ0YwOWdKbUs4QTlUWWFoSjZUbEhyRndCa1pvWnJPYW5KTHpoV0xqZnlwV3V6NkVnRHp4TzFJemFTcEpaYkxXNk9pVzFWaTZ0U2loXzBwMnFvYmNyamZzMmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5wenV4UGRtcTg3SFF4a0pKSk4xb1J0MTRkNGU4N2R3U0Jnaktrd3lkZE1NNHpDMFBrU1RzWVYzSkd1NEZoS1NDOTRsaUo4ak5FS3V6Tzl1WnFtMWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GhanaWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQTHRjUjBqY0hlVm1XWXN1SWdLaDlUS1dFZkVpYmFfUzRIbVdHSVMzZ3l3ck40cjVRQVpaQlhFeDVxaktBNDBVNkRWTDcyUHY5T2hpM2UtWDJvRzk0OEF6Z1lQam1YdFhybnJGdFpNbkhabjlSQ3owcy1sbnBwcjR5TWM1NzlxU0VBU1NYZFlLRndVckNCZk1vbGpTZGR2X1U4SFc5VE5oazFGakE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFBlN1B6RzFWTGZwZUpDYkM2a2xuUlMtZmtOVEVoVEphM3N1anVyeFcyR3ZlN20tREtLR19PVWJmRlpkbjk0alF6ekR0T2R5MWVTd0JaZ0pOVEJ6RG9XWmVEVVpHbjNQcFN3eVo0UnM4YVRaMnMyNFlwZ0